# Projects under ~/Projects whose devshell stays out of the store GC.
#
# GC keeps only store paths that a gc root points at, and a plain
# `nix develop` creates no root, so a devshell and its dependencies are
# collected on the next run. `projects.sh pin` links each project listed
# here to a gc root at ~/.local/state/nix/gcroots/projects/<name>, so its
# devshell closure is never collected. Re-pin after a flake.lock moves, or
# run it from a timer.
#
# One path per line, relative to ~/Projects, so nested projects work too.
# `projects.sh find` lists every flake on disk and whether it is here.
#
# tangled/core and tangled/ting/core are left out on purpose: their devshell
# overrides stdenv to pkgsStatic, so pinning them compiles 504 derivations
# locally (no cache hit for a static Rust/Go toolchain). Add them as a pair
# only if you work inside that shell often.
apalaka
at-advent-codes
duskyelf.com
jee-prep
tangled/ting
txm
Vimophone
